<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Hell -->
  <DD_Hell_Weather.label>地狱</DD_Hell_Weather.label>
  <!-- EN: Sulfur, flames, and putrid odors - Hell is a mirror image of the real world. When the believers of the Twin-Tail pray to Hell Dive Shrine, Hell briefly enters the mortal reality.All lands outside the protection of the Hell Dive Shrine will be scorched by the Hell's Burning Wind. The Hell Legion, born from the abyss, will relentlessly attack the colonies until the delve is over and they leave Hell. -->
  <DD_Hell_Weather.description>硫磺、火焰与腐臭的气息——地狱是现实世界的镜像，当双尾教国的信众们向地狱深潜神龛祈唤时，地狱便会短暂地进入现世。\n\n在地狱深潜神龛庇护范围外的所有土地将遭受地狱焚风的灼烧，从深渊中诞生的地狱军团会不断地进攻殖民地，直到深潜结束离开地狱。</DD_Hell_Weather.description>
  
</LanguageData>